From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: one-shot leftover drain after ENABLE_REPORT timeout

since16 stopped polling on ENABLE_REPORT timeout, so the leftover
continued_read dump (plen=13325) was never read. Level-ATTN stays
asserted; IRQ 244 does not re-fire; wait_for_completion times out.

Fix: after write_message returns -ETIME (command_mutex already
released), read_message once to drain the leftover, discard it, retry
ENABLE_REPORT once. Never set do_polling or queue polling_work.

If retry also times out, set report_touch_cmd_sent without polling so
IRQ-delivered REPORT_TOUCH can still be processed after ATTN drops.

Applies after syna-tcm-stop-poll-dump.patch.

--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/synaptics/td4150/synaptics_tcm_core.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/synaptics/td4150/synaptics_tcm_core.c
@@ -2426,9 +2426,6 @@
